## Interface: 16001
## Title: CleanRangedSounds
## Notes: Mutes the bow creak before each shot and any other bow, crossbow or gun sound you pick.
## Author: miyanko
## Version: 1.0.0
## Category: Media
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Weapon_Bow_05
## SavedVariables: CleanRangedSoundsDB
## AddonCompartmentFunc: CleanRangedSounds_CompartmentClick
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnEnter: CleanRangedSounds_CompartmentEnter
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: CleanRangedSounds_CompartmentLeave

# Load order is the dependency order: Sounds owns the sound list, the saved settings, the muting and
# playback, Release plays a kept shot sound on your own shots, and Options builds the settings
# panel, the slash command and the addon-menu entry on top of both.

Core\Sounds.lua
Core\Release.lua
UI\Options.lua
